{"id":"02265763bed70209","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-cat-limit-cone.md","title":"ZFC Cat Limit Cone","display":"df-zfc-cat-limit-cone — ZFC Cat Limit Cone","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-limit-cone","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-limit-cone"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-limit-cone — ZFC Cat Limit Cone","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-universal-cone]]","[[58-df-functor]]","[[58-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-limit-cone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-limit-cone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-limit-cone — ZFC Cat Limit Cone"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e56495c9794b9dd7\" href=\"?note=e56495c9794b9dd7\" title=\"58-df-universal-cone\">58-df-universal-cone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (index category)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:J\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(D:J\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> (diagram)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (candidate limit object)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (cone with vertex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (ambient category)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\\)</span> (five-argument universal-cone predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e56495c9794b9dd7\" href=\"?note=e56495c9794b9dd7\" title=\"58-df-universal-cone\">58-df-universal-cone</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatLimitCone}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatLimitCone}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}limit\\text{-}cone} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatLimitCone}_S(L,\\lambda,D,J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}limit\\text{-}cone} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatLimitCone}_S(L,\\lambda,D,J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The exact universal-cone predicate receives the same explicit ambient and index categories, preventing its compatibility form from existentially choosing unrelated categories.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-universal-cone","status":"resolved","id":"e56495c9794b9dd7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-universal-cone]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[58-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[58-df-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-universal-cone","status":"resolved","id":"e56495c9794b9dd7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S$ (five-argument universal-cone predicate, see [[58-df-universal-cone]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"D:J\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatLimitCone}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}limit\\text{-}cone} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatLimitCone}_S(L,\\lambda,D,J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\lambda)","display":true}],"bytes":1307,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1563","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-cat-limit-cone.md|58-df-zfc-cat-limit-cone]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e56495c9794b9dd7","877f1061e295cf5f","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}